{"id":"ad4abd8fd2bf0913","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-continuous-code.md","title":"ZFC Continuous Code","display":"df-zfc-continuous-code — ZFC Continuous Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-continuous-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-continuous-code"],"display":"df-zfc-continuous-code — ZFC Continuous Code","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-continuous-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-continuous-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-continuous-code — ZFC Continuous Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,f,X,Y\\in V\">\\(c,f,X,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\\;\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\;\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}code} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ContinuousCode}_S(c,f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,X^{&lt;\\omega},Y^{&lt;\\omega})\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in X^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(s\\sqsubseteq t\\to c(s)\\sqsubseteq c(t))\\land\n\\forall x\\in X^\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(m\\leq|c(x{\\upharpoonright}n)|\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X^\\omega,Y^\\omega)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X^\\omega\\;\n\\left(f(x)=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}c(x{\\upharpoonright}n)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}code} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ContinuousCode}_S(c,f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,X^{&lt;\\omega},Y^{&lt;\\omega})\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in X^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(s\\sqsubseteq t\\to c(s)\\sqsubseteq c(t))\\land\n\\forall x\\in X^\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(m\\leq|c(x{\\upharpoonright}n)|\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X^\\omega,Y^\\omega)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X^\\omega\\;\n\\left(f(x)=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}c(x{\\upharpoonright}n)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Monotonicity makes the finite outputs compatible, and unbounded output length makes their union a total <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>-valued branch.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c,f,X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sqsubseteq\\;\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousCode}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}code} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ContinuousCode}_S(c,f,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(c,X^{<\\omega},Y^{<\\omega})\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in X^{<\\omega}\\;(s\\sqsubseteq t\\to c(s)\\sqsubseteq c(t))\\land\n\\forall x\\in X^\\omega\\;\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(m\\leq|c(x{\\upharpoonright}n)|\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X^\\omega,Y^\\omega)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X^\\omega\\;\n\\left(f(x)=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}c(x{\\upharpoonright}n)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":1126,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1776","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-continuous-code.md|58-df-zfc-continuous-code]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}